          "role": "user",
          "content": "Hi there! I\u2019d like to book a one\u2011way flight from Chicago O\u2019Hare (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) for May\u202f26. I want the exact same flight I took on May\u202f10 (I don\u2019t have the flight number handy, but it was the same route and date).  \n\nI\u2019d like to add an extra passenger, Kevin\u202fSmith (DOB\u202f2001\u201104\u201112). No checked bags for either of us. We\u2019re fine with economy and would like an aisle seat for me and a middle seat right next to it.  \n\nI\u2019m willing to spend up to $500 total. If the total price comes in over that amount, please drop the second passenger and book only my ticket.  \n\nI don\u2019t need travel insurance, and I\u2019d like to pay using one of my certificates only\u2014no other payment method.  \n\nMy name is Sophia\u202fSilva (user ID: sophia_silva_7557). Let me know what you need from me to move forward.",
